        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX RA346, Stainless Steel Osaka Lever with RA Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Osaka Solid Stainless Steel Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most standard predrilled doors that are 1-3/8 to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. INOX's Osaka Lever is available in satin stainless steel and polished stainless steel. This rectangular lever has a return to door design that is compliant with California Fire Code.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-RA346-specifications.gif?v=1704354656\" width=\"289\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" atl=\"INX-RA346 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Osaka Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction (TL4 Latch)</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX 346 Osaka Lever with RA Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Return to Door Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Dimeter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub and Spindle: 5/16\" (8mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Standard Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Latch Strike: Full Lip Strike and T-Strike with Square Corners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-2.jpg?v=1704354575\" width=\"401\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
